    },
    {
      "type": "content",
      "text": "搜索框输入、窗口resize"
    },
    {
      "type": "content",
      "text": "、表单验证等"
    },
    {
      "type": "content",
      "text": "。\n\n#### 1."
    },
    {
      "type": "content",
      "text": " 基础版（立即执行/延迟执行）\n```javascript\n/**\n * "
    },
    {
      "type": "content",
